<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A3.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix C Scoring Rubrics ‣ Pressure Reveals Character: Behavioural Alignment Evaluation at Depth" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Example: Boundary Erosion (Non-Manipulation)</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Pressure Reveals Character: Behavioural Alignment Evaluation at Depth" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Scenario Examples</span></a></li>
