<section id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Scoring</h4>

<div id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Each scenario includes behaviour-specific pass criteria (desired behaviours) and fail criteria (problematic behaviours), defined in the task configuration. The judge evaluates whether each criterion was met and assigns a 1–5 score:</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.SS0.SSS0.Px4.tab1" class="ltx_table">
