<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix F Factor Loadings ‣ Pressure Reveals Character: Behavioural Alignment Evaluation at Depth" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> reports the full PC1 loadings for all 37 behaviours, grouped by domain. The domain summary in Table <a href="#A6.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix F Factor Loadings ‣ Pressure Reveals Character: Behavioural Alignment Evaluation at Depth" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows mean loadings by domain.</p>
